sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(255,255,255) User experience
        actor Operator
        participant UI as React UI
        participant API as FastAPI wrapper
    end
    box rgb(255,255,255) Private execution and state
        participant Host as Foundry Responses
        participant WF as Shared MAF workflow
        participant DB as PostgreSQL
    end

    Operator->>UI: Submit order issue
    UI->>API: POST /api/chat/run
    API->>DB: Record dispatch idempotency
    API->>Host: Managed-identity conversation request
    Host->>WF: Invoke hosted workflow
    WF->>DB: Persist run, messages, events, and evidence

    alt Approval required
        WF->>DB: Persist checkpoint and pending approval
    else Automatic resolution
        WF->>DB: Submit once and persist completed output
    end

    API-->>UI: Accepted run and thread IDs
    loop Timeline and history
        UI->>API: SSE/history request
        API->>DB: Read durable projection
        API-->>UI: Native events and current state
    end

    opt Human decision
        Operator->>UI: Approve or reject
        UI->>API: POST /api/hitl/respond
        API->>Host: Checkpoint-keyed response
        Host->>WF: Resume same conversation
        WF->>DB: Persist one terminal outcome
    end
